WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:02.860
Mom?

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.660
It's me again

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.840
Where is everyone?

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.940
It's been nine days.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.700
We're all alone.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.840
Some of us thought it would be fun...

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.060
to be in charge of ourselves.

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:28.940
But things got bad.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.400
If you hear this...

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:52.620
Please come find us.

